{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"b664f53bc86c9900","type":"text","text":"The Bathhouse\n\n- Looks like this tunnel was flooded by the bathhouse overflowing\n- The water steams, despite being just a little too cold for comfort.\n- Brackets in the wall for torches, empty. The window has been bricked up.\n- The walls are strangely clear of algae.\n- If the party turns their backs on any of the statues, they disappear.\n","x":-240,"y":-210,"width":260,"height":410,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"3ca0147bb7c81d31","type":"text","text":"IDEally target Ragna, Jayson, or Vrek\n\nRagna\n- Seems more fearless than usual\n- **Your scarf feels like its choking you - remove it.**\n\nRoque:\n- **Walks with the sunblade off.**\n\nJayson\n- **Keeps the helmet on**\n- Quiet, serious.\n\nVrek \n- **Will attempt to get back.**\n","x":60,"y":-360,"width":300,"height":600},
		{"id":"96ca09811613a80f","type":"text","text":"POSESSION:\n\n*As you lag behind the party, you feel a cold touch sink into your body.*\n\nDulgoth Steelstrike is attempting to posess a party member, in order to once again try to get to his wife in the central chamber.","x":65,"y":-640,"width":250,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"29637cb40f50bb64","type":"text","text":"Changing Room\n\n- Can hear the distant sound of froghemeth. (PP 19)\n- Heavy doors will attempt to separate the party - first chance for possession.","x":-560,"y":-210,"width":250,"height":290},
		{"id":"4f4f6addead537ca","type":"text","text":"Corner Guard Tower\n\n*Amongst the fallen stone and rusted weaponry are telltale slime trails - a frogemeth has nested here.*\n- A slimy clutch of eggs lies in the botton left\n- The momma is defending her nest.\n\nLoot:\n- Torturer's Necklace","x":-560,"y":-560,"width":250,"height":260},
		{"id":"4378381f9a20480d","type":"text","text":"Sitting Room\n\n*This appears to be an old sitting room - used to be, anyway. Large rocks cluster about the floor, and snow covers the few things that remain, continuing to rot them away.*","x":-860,"y":-560,"width":250,"height":260},
		{"id":"140f5f8288823a80","type":"text","text":"🐸Froghemeths\n\nAs per stat block except:\n- Resistance to magical weapons \n- Ranged magical damage is reflected back at the user.\n\n\n\n\n","x":380,"y":-640,"width":250,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"027aa68f82d0215f","type":"text","text":"- excrete sticky slimy mucus out of their skin that gives it a high level of magic refraction. they're not particularly well armored, but magic will bounce right back to its source - THE SUNBLADE WOULD JUST BOUNCE RIGHT OFF (froghemoth has resistance to magic weapons) - one exception: lightning seems to frazzle them significantly and mess with their reflexes","x":660,"y":-640,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"c430f58110154306","type":"text","text":"Gardener's Bedroom\n\n- Blocked by weeds outside: NOISY to remove.\n- A dusty unkempt room; the last people to come through here did so a long time ago.\n\nLoot\n- **Staffkeeper's Charm** here that allows access through charmed doors.","x":-985,"y":-60,"width":250,"height":175},
		{"id":"65bb8a0ee1a29ad3","type":"text","text":"","x":-690,"y":-100,"width":80,"height":360},
		{"id":"49dff4a9419c517d","type":"text","text":"Skeleton Spawner (Trap)\n- If PCs *don't* push on the right wall as they pass, the left will open up and expose 8 armed skeletons. \n- Spawner is turned off by hitting the button behind the podium - the button on top saying \"off\" will spawn 8 more.","x":-985,"y":148,"width":250,"height":112,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ed9c10b1b8b0a532","type":"text","text":"Parlor\n\n*The smell of rotting wood and textiles is accentuated by the humidity. Mushrooms bloom along the table. Animal heads line the south side and a fire place lays dormant.*","x":-560,"y":115,"width":250,"height":145},
		{"id":"cedfa6dfcb2ed8d3","type":"text","text":"","x":-690,"y":300,"width":80,"height":420},
		{"id":"e6684a1d12ba6e0a","type":"text","text":"Chapel Entrance\n**Something foul lingers here.**\n\n*These doors are different to those that have come before. While dulled in shine, the doors glint with an inlay of gold. The carvings on the door make sense at first glance, but seem to warp the more you look at them.*\n\n","x":-560,"y":300,"width":250,"height":220},
		{"id":"d9716321e0a24e10","type":"text","text":"Hierophane, Of Wretched Life and Hunger.  \n\n- A Great Old One whose domain crosses over into undeath.","x":380,"y":-360,"width":320,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"3354ebed2a1bfbfc","type":"text","text":"Fight:\n- Main monster is a **Bone Lord**\n- 2x **Bone Naga** supports\n- 4x candleholders spawn **Living Wicks*\n- Must be *doused in water or the candles removed.*\n\nLair Action\n- Unholy howl\n\t- CHA save (15?) or frightened.","x":20,"y":300,"width":280,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d2081c49ec7ee350","type":"text","text":"Chapel\n\n- Ke'nan: can see a figure praying - when it looks to Ke'nan, it's eyes gleam like the inside of oyster shells.","x":-260,"y":300,"width":250,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c56aa2fb47e2654e","type":"text","text":"Greenhouse\n\nThe lair of a **Vine Lord**, who will attack indiscriminately. ","x":-1280,"y":-60,"width":250,"height":175,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6c44088326e61a4e","type":"text","text":"","x":-1377,"y":-187,"width":477,"height":60},
		{"id":"f886d7b13ee4bcc0","type":"text","text":"","x":-1377,"y":-100,"width":50,"height":215},
		{"id":"3d6a9c1ea405999e","type":"text","text":"","x":-1377,"y":-520,"width":56,"height":283},
		{"id":"d7b2e73451060a93","type":"text","text":"Store Room\n\n- Ghost will try to knock something over and seperate the party.","x":-560,"y":549,"width":250,"height":191},
		{"id":"7058a083773097ed","type":"text","text":"Servent's Hall\n- x1 trap, to keep unruly servents in line\n- ","x":-560,"y":760,"width":250,"height":140},
		{"id":"d6ac09f4a0b2f9e3","type":"text","text":"Dungeon Prep Room\n- One way wall into the torture room.\n- Stairs down to the larger torture chamber\n- supplies that have been whittled away","x":-560,"y":920,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"163ce9e758166c2a","type":"text","text":"Dungeon Entrance\n**Something foul lingers here.**\n\n- Requires three different picks DC 25, or uses of the spell *Knock.*\n- A *Torturer's Necklace* and *Staffkeeper's Charm* removes one check.","x":-645,"y":1080,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0e635875ed551431","type":"text","text":"Jail\n\n- Can find innocent ghosts here.","x":-880,"y":1080,"width":210,"height":80},
		{"id":"af111aea3fd458e5","type":"text","text":"","x":-690,"y":740,"width":80,"height":280},
		{"id":"a2239b43b7f98330","type":"text","text":"","x":-960,"y":960,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a3246ca1c345744d","type":"text","text":"Dungeon Tower\n\n- Trapped\n- The bottom right room attempts to compel somebody into the chair, making them thing this is what needs to be done to solve the puzzle.\n- If so will be possessed by **Vylass Switchborne**. He's trapped in the mindset of being tortured, over and over.\n- Need to \"alleviate the unholy presence\"","x":-105,"y":1080,"width":250,"height":160},
		{"id":"45ed03b4fdfee542","type":"text","text":"Dungeon\n","x":-310,"y":1080,"width":175,"height":160},
		{"id":"e30c0e65f1daece3","type":"text","text":"","x":-860,"y":-187,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8a00be65a34ddf34","type":"text","text":"Ghosts","x":380,"y":-95,"width":320,"height":123},
		{"id":"0b0116ea3a5c3d32","type":"text","text":"Hierophane, Writhing \nDame of Endless Want,\nYour putrid breath gives life to decay,\nAnd decay to life anew.\nWe, your wretched children, gnaw at existence,\nForever famished for that which eludes our grasp.\nGrant us the curse of your unquenchable hunger,\nThat we may devour possibility itself.\nIn the spaces between life and undeath,\nWe squirm and sicken with desire.\nFill our hollowed bones with yearning,\nOur desiccated flesh with need.\nO Hierophane! Bestow upon us\nThe gift of eternal dissatisfaction,\nThat we may rise from our graves\nStill ravenous for the feast of being.\nLet our eyes gleam with unholy appetite,\nOur tongues forever parched for forbidden nectar.\nIn your name, we renounce satiety,\nAnd embrace the torment of perpetual craving.\nHierophane! Hierophane!\nMay your insidious hunger consume us,\nUntil we are naught but desire incarnate,\nTrapped in the hellish cycle of want and woe.","x":740,"y":-432,"width":250,"height":920}
	],
